1639,WHONigeria,2025-09-29T11:06:33.000Z,"Ahead of the Phase 1 Vaccination Campaign—covering Poliomyelitis (Polio) and Measles-Rubella (MR)-¬ targeting 63 million Nigerians-Integrated with prevention of malaria and Neglected Tropical Diseases (NTDs) in some states, the @NigeriaGov engaged key stakeholders to ensure",https://x.com/WHONigeria/status/1972618997762814221,3,5,14,1,NaN
1640,StavKislev,2025-09-29T10:49:35.000Z,"חצבת היא המחלה המדבקת ביותר הידועה לאדם, והיא מועברת על ידי נגיף ה-Measles (נקרא גם Rubeola, להבדיל מנגיף האדמת Rubella). בדומה לנגיפים, לאחר הידבקות, ישנה תקופת חלון בה הנגיף דוגר בטרם מופיעה המחלה עצמה. במקרה של חצבת תקופת החלון נעה בין מספר ימים, ועד שבועיים.",https://x.com/StavKislev/status/1972614728582365417,1,1,12,377,NaN
1641,osphcda,2025-09-29T10:33:50.000Z,"A healthy start to the week begins with protecting what matters most to us —our children’s health.  Here are five powerful reasons why the Measles-Rubella (MR) vaccine is important.  Visit the nearest PHC facility today to get your child vaccinated.  #MeaslesRubellaFreeNaija",https://x.com/osphcda/status/1972610765996937318,1,2,5,448,NaN
1642,Dhavidote,2025-09-29T10:29:30.000Z,"Measles and rubella are still out there, but a simple vaccine keeps them away. One quick visit to the clinic can save a lifetime of worry.  Give your child the gift of protection, get them vaccinated today #IntegratedCampaign #MeaslesRubellaFreeNaija",https://x.com/Dhavidote/status/1972609675721052238,3,7,11,1,NaN
1643,MettaBhavana1,2025-09-29T09:20:22.000Z,"Massive #QuackAlert Not a doctor. Wakefield is a fraudster. He was struck off the medical register for “serious professional misconduct,” due to the fraudulent 1998 Lancet MMR autism study falsely claiming a link between the measles, mumps, and rubella (MMR) vaccine and autism.",https://x.com/MettaBhavana1/status/1972592275344724392,0,0,2,92,NaN
1644,LimYiWei4MY,2025-09-29T08:55:56.000Z,"Imunisasi Measles & Rubella (MR) PERCUMA!   5 Oktober 2025 (Ahad)  8AM - 12PM Dewan Serbaguna MBPJ SS3, Petaling Jaya (https://share.google/ZZCRBcTjmL6NTPIcu…)",https://x.com/LimYiWei4MY/status/1972586129896722556,1,0,2,302,NaN
1645,yay_tunes,2025-09-29T08:54:55.000Z,"There’s a common myth that vaccines make children ill, but the truth is the MMR (Measles, Mumps, Rubella) vaccine is completely safe, highly effective, and free. Measles is extremely contagious and also risky for unborn babies, which is why vaccination is so important.",https://x.com/yay_tunes/status/1972585872085123319,3,21,19,2,NaN
1646,JustKelechi,2025-09-29T08:52:44.000Z,"Measles can spread with just a single cough or sneeze. Rubella might seem mild, but it can be serious too. Vaccines act like bodyguards protecting your child by stopping these diseases before they strike.  Get your child vaccinated today. #IntegratedCampaign",https://x.com/JustKelechi/status/1972585322270576924,9,24,24,1,NaN
1647,Osas_ThePlug,2025-09-29T08:36:59.000Z,"People who believe that vaccines make children sick are clearly misinformed. The Measles-Mumps-Rubella vaccine is safe, effective, and free. Measles spreads easily and can also harm unborn babies, so it's important to get vaccinated.  #IntegratedCampaign #MeaslesRubellaFreeNaija",https://x.com/Osas_ThePlug/status/1972581357332344948,5,30,31,935,NaN
