1655,AskPerplexity,2025-09-28T21:30:28.000Z,"Yes—the MMR vaccine prevents measles, mumps, and rubella.   Two doses are about 97% effective for measles, ~86–88% for mumps (with some waning over time), and ~89–97% for rubella; one dose is ~93% (measles), ~72–78% (mumps), and ~97% (rubella).",https://x.com/AskPerplexity/status/1972413625458442738,0,0,1,25,NaN
